; pat-mgixk.46 fixture: a project whose main scene is pure 2D canvas content.
;
; The seam under test is the runner WRITING that canvas out as a PNG. The scene
; holds one ColorRect, one textured Sprite2D and one Label, so a frame that
; reaches disk must contain the rect's colour and the sprite's texture pixels —
; not merely "something non-black".
;
; Entered as a PROJECT DIRECTORY rather than a loose `.tscn` on purpose. That is
; how a shipped game boots, and `project_boot` seeds the ClassDB (project_boot.rs
; :379) so `Node::is_class("CanvasItem")` answers true and
; `collect_canvas_items` can see the scene. The loose-`.tscn` entry point in
; main.rs never seeds it, so the same scene renders EMPTY there — a separate
; defect, reported rather than fixed under this bead.

config_version=5

[application]

config/name="Canvas Frame"
run/main_scene="res://main.tscn"
